{"_path":"/articles/nuxt-4-guide","_dir":"articles","_draft":false,"_partial":false,"_locale":"","title":"Nuxt 4 Guide","description":"A comprehensive guide to getting started with Nuxt 4, including installation, configuration, and best practices.","date":"2024-08-01","category":"Nuxt 4","tags":["Nuxt 4","Guide"],"body":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tag":"h1","props":{"id":"nuxt-4-guide"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Nuxt 4 Guide"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Nuxt 4 is a powerful framework for building server-side rendered (SSR) applications with Vue.js. This guide will walk you through the essential steps to get started with Nuxt 4, including installation, configuration, and best practices."}]},{"type":"element","tag":"h2","props":{"id":"主要特性"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"主要特性"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"更快的启动速度"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Nuxt 4 通过优化构建过程和减少初始加载时间，提供了更快的启动速度。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"增强的模块系统"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Nuxt 4 提供了更灵活的模块系统，使开发者可以轻松地扩展应用功能。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"改进的路由机制"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Nuxt 4 引入了更智能的路由机制，支持动态路由和嵌套路由。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"更好的开发体验"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Nuxt 4 提供了更好的开发工具和调试功能，使开发者能够更高效地构建应用。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"支持最新的 Vue 3 特性"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Nuxt 4 完全支持 Vue 3 的新特性，如组合式 API、Teleport 和 Suspense。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"更强的性能优化"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Nuxt 4 提供了多种性能优化策略，包括代码分割、懒加载和静态生成，帮助开发者构建高性能的应用。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"更好的 SEO 支持"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Nuxt 4 提供了更好的 SEO 支持，包括自动生成的 meta 标签和友好的 URL 结构，帮助应用在搜索引擎中获得更好的排名。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"更强的社区支持"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Nuxt 4 拥有活跃的社区和丰富的插件生态系统，开发者可以轻松找到所需的资源和支持。"}]}]}],"toc":{"title":"","searchDepth":2,"depth":2,"links":[{"id":"主要特性","depth":2,"text":"主要特性"}]}},"_type":"markdown","_id":"content:articles:nuxt-4-guide.md","_source":"content","_file":"articles/nuxt-4-guide.md","_stem":"articles/nuxt-4-guide","_extension":"md"}